Third-party vendored code
==========================

This directory (third_party/SARA/) contains a vendored copy of the SARA project:

    SARA: Salience-Aware Reinforced Adaptive Decoding
    Upstream: https://github.com/wkw1259/SARA
    Builds upon: https://github.com/zhichaoxu-shufe/context-aware-decoding-qfs
    Vendored on: 2026-07-28

The upstream repository ships no LICENSE file. It is vendored here unmodified
except for the additions listed below, and is kept isolated under third_party/
so its provenance is explicit. If you intend to redistribute this repository,
confirm the licensing status of the upstream code first.

Local additions/modifications (by this repo, on top of upstream SARA)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
Purpose: port three reference-free reward components from the summarize_rl
project into SARA's self-critical reward, and let SARA train/test on the
summarize_rl Korean corpus (data/scenarios_ko.jsonl).

- src/reward_extras.py            NEW. Ported reward helpers (triplet coverage,
                                  ungrounded-fact/hallucination penalty, Gemini
                                  LLM-as-judge) + the summarize_rl data loader.
                                  Ported from summarize_rl/{rewards,judge}.py,
                                  branches.py, examples/eval_gemini.py.
- src/utils.py                    Evaluator gains calculate_triplet_coverage /
                                  calculate_ungrounded_fact_penalty /
                                  calculate_judge; load_dataset_ours +
                                  "summarize_rl_ko" branch in load_dataset and
                                  the input decoders.
- src/test_performance_decoder_new_fc.py
                                  get_self_critical_reward gains the three
                                  weighted terms; new argparse weights
                                  (--triplet_coverage_weight, --hallu_weight,
                                  --judge_weight, --judge_gemini_model); KB
                                  triplets threaded from data into the reward.
- tests/test_reward_extras.py     NEW. Unit tests for the above (stdlib only).
- INTEGRATION_ko.md               NEW. Korean usage notes + known limitations.
